Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: mailbox: google: Add Tensor G4 compatible

Describe the Tensor G4 AP-to-APM mailbox with the gs101 fallback. It uses
the same interrupt-mask register at 0x28 and outgoing doorbell at 0x40,
with sixteen flag bits. The complete public transport driver is byte-
identical to the one used by the qualified tegu private kernel, whose
DT already has this exact compatible pair. No new driver data is needed.

The existing schema rejects that pair. Extend its gs201 fallback pattern
without changing any legacy layout. Meta-schema and W=1 example checks
pass. Independent scoped validation accepts the actual cached G4 node,
preserves the gs101, gs201 and exynos850 cases, and rejects a missing or
wrong G4 fallback. No hardware operation or clock-provider qualification
is performed by this binding-only change.

Source: Google's GPL SoC modules at
204078758737776959ecc85c527a00fd2cabb62f,
drivers/soc/google/acpm/acpm_ipc.h; own qualified tegu DT capture.

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml        | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
index 713a4e594..d1a6c6eda 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/mailbox/google,gs101-mbox.yaml
@@ -25,7 +25,9 @@ properties:
           - google,gs101-mbox
           - samsung,exynos850-mbox
       - items:
-          - const: google,gs201-mbox
+          - enum:
+              - google,gs201-mbox
+              - google,zumapro-mbox
           - const: google,gs101-mbox
 
   reg:
